2. Contract bytecode (examples/mainnet/*.hex)

   These files are the runtime bytecode of smart contracts deployed on public
   blockchains (Uniswap, SushiSwap, PancakeSwap, QuickSwap, Trader Joe,
   Biswap, ApeSwap, Compound, Venus, Aave, Circle, MakerDAO and the WETH9
   contract). They were read unmodified from the chains listed in
   examples/mainnet/manifest.json and are included only as test fixtures and
   benchmark data.

